# Canadian English dialect overlay for Editoria11y.
#
# This file is a minimal overlay over the American-English source strings
# in template/general.pot. Only entries whose Canadian spelling differs
# from the American source appear here; all other strings fall back to
# the msgid via Drupal's locale layer (empty/absent msgstr = use source).
#
# Canadian English keeps American -ize/-yze verb endings (organize,
# analyze, recognize) and -er spellings (center, theater). It diverges
# from American on -our nouns (colour, behaviour, favour, labour,
# neighbour) and on noun/verb licence/license, practice/practise,
# defence/offence. That's a much smaller set than en-gb.
#
# Add a new entry only when general.pot gains a string that contains a
# dialect-sensitive word. scripts/scan-dialect-strings.sh flags candidates.
# This file is NOT updated by scripts/sync-translations.sh.
